pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: 全文最重要的一页。中间用 DAG 示意：前向是执行，回传的不是梯度而是轨迹子图。右侧三点解释为什么轨迹能承担梯度的角色。
elements:
  - elementId: label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 40, 300, 18]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      text: 01 · 核心洞察
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 64, 860, 38]
    content:
      style: "$pagetitle"
      text: 执行轨迹 ≈ 不可微系统的"梯度"
  - elementId: claim
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 112, 420, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$gray"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>工作流视作计算图：节点是输入 / 参数 / 计算结果，边是"谁由谁计算而来"。反向传播传播梯度；Trace 传播<strong>执行轨迹</strong>。</p>
  - elementId: n1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 240, 76, 44]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [24000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$soft"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$gray"}
  - elementId: n1t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 240, 76, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: 输入 map
  - elementId: n2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [196, 240, 76, 44]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [24000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: n2t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [196, 240, 76, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#F7F3E8"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: 参数 θ
  - elementId: n3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [332, 240, 76, 44]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [24000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$soft"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$gray"}
  - elementId: n3t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [332, 240, 76, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: 中间结果
  - elementId: n4
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [468, 240, 76, 44]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [24000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$soft"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$gray"}
  - elementId: n4t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [468, 240, 76, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: 输出 + 反馈 f
  - elementId: e1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [136, 258, 60, 8]
    viewBox: [60, 8]
    points: "0,4 60,4"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: e2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [272, 258, 60, 8]
    viewBox: [60, 8]
    points: "0,4 60,4"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: e3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [408, 258, 60, 8]
    viewBox: [60, 8]
    points: "0,4 60,4"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: fwd-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [136, 218, 300, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$gray"
      align: [center, top]
      text: 前向：执行工作流，记录轨迹
  - elementId: bwd
    elementType: line
    bounds: [200, 310, 340, 40]
    viewBox: [340, 40]
    points: "340,0 170,40 0,0"
    curve: smooth
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: dash, width: 2, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: bwd-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [200, 352, 340, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$primary"
      align: [center, top]
      text: 回传：最小子图 g + 反馈 f（而非梯度 ∇）
  - elementId: right-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [560, 120, 1, 300]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: points
    elementType: text
    bounds: [592, 118, 330, 320]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p><strong>① 轨迹记录了"中间结果如何被使用"</strong></p>
        <p><span style="color:$gray; font-size:12px;">这是把输出端反馈归因到上游参数所需的全部信息。</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px"><strong>② 严格包含反向传播</strong></p>
        <p><span style="color:$gray; font-size:12px;">论文证明：可微分情形下，传播轨迹的 backward 就是梯度反传——AutoDiff 是 Trace 的特例。</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px"><strong>③ 对不可微工作流仍然成立</strong></p>
        <p><span style="color:$gray; font-size:12px;">LLM、代码、模拟器无所谓"梯度"，但都有执行轨迹——人类工程师本来就用轨迹 debug 分布式系统。</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px"><strong>④ 最小子图控制成本</strong></p>
        <p><span style="color:$gray; font-size:12px;">只把与参数有因果关系的子图交给优化器，等价于只回传相关梯度。</span></p>
  - elementId: foot-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 514, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: foot
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 520, 600, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: Trace is the Next AutoDiff · §1.1 / §3.3
  - elementId: page-no
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 520, 32, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, top]
      text: "04"
